  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{dx}}\\{\\mathrm{f}(\\mathrm{x})\\}=\\mathrm{g}(\\mathrm{x})$, then $\\int_a^b \\mathrm{f}(\\mathrm{x}) \\mathrm{g}(\\mathrm{x}) \\mathrm{dx}$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "KpWNu",
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\\mathrm{f}^2(\\mathrm{~b})-\\mathrm{f}^2(\\mathrm{a})\\right]$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "QjH9b",
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\\mathrm{~g}^2(\\mathrm{~b})-\\mathrm{g}^2(\\mathrm{a})\\right]$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "VkIj3",
      "text": "$f(b)-f(a)$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cPBdn",
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\\mathrm{f}\\left(\\mathrm{b}^2\\right)-\\mathrm{f}\\left(\\mathrm{a}^2\\right)\\right]$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints $: f(x)=\\int g(x) d x$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\int_a^b f(x) \\cdot g(x) \\cdot d x=(f(x) f(x))_a^b-\\int_a^b g(x) f(x) d x \\\\\n& I=f^2(b)-f^n(a)^{-1} \\\\\n& I=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(f^2(b)-f^2(a)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
